					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Junkichi"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220170301,
					"content": "Traveler, did you bring those novels? Let's have a look.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2201704,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2201706
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2201706",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2201706,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Shigeru",
					"Junkichi"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220170401,
					"content": "I remember this one. This suspense novel was popular for a long time, wasn't it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170402,
					"content": "The reason for its success is because of the clever mysteries and plot structure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170403,
					"content": "Although many readers have said that part of the plot is impossible to follow, the author still stuck to their own principles.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170404,
					"content": "That's why this novel stands out from other suspense novels.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170405,
					"content": "But doesn't this novel also have a solid setting? A solid setting that isn't easily altered is the key to support the plot of this sort of suspense novel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170406,
					"content": "Uh... well... Traveler, do we have any other books here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2201705,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2201705
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2201705",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2201705,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Shigeru",
					"Junkichi"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220170501,
					"content": "How about this one, then? I remember its writing was excellent and its plot was well-designed. It was highly praised by the editors. Also, its sales were excellent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170502,
					"content": "...Was it, though?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170503,
					"content": "It was so caught up with the rigid plot and setting that it didn't have any room for expansion in the story. In the end, it just became repetitive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170504,
					"content": "It gradually lost readers because it lacked fresh stories. In the end, it lost all of its readers and fizzled out ignominiously.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170505,
					"content": "Whether it's the setting or the plot, if you put yourself inside a box, all your stories will look the same. You'll stagnate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170506,
					"content": "I don't want my novel to be like that! The most important thing a story should have is life!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170507,
					"content": "If... if the author himself is not interested in his own story, how can he make the reader feel that same passion?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170508,
					"content": "Shigeru!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170509,
					"content": "...I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170510,
					"content": "I didn't know that you thought so much about these things. No wonder you wrote a novel like \"Onibudou.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170511,
					"content": "I don't want to limit your creativity, but I've seen too many authors ruin their work because of their excessive imagination...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170512,
					"content": "Junkichi, what do you think of creativity as a writer?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170513,
					"content": "I believe that it's the desire to create. A writer who has no desire to create won't be able to write words that attract readers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170514,
					"content": "In my opinion, it's more important still for a writer to exercise restraint in expressing that creative desire.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170515,
						220170516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170515,
					"content": "You two still can't reach a consensus...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220170517,
					"content": "Shigeru, I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170518,
					"content": "But I'm not the author of this novel. You are. I'm just an editor who needs to help you finish it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170519,
					"content": "If you insist on your ideas, then create them as you wish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170520,
					"content": "I can't say that I agree with you. But I will try to understand you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170521,
					"content": "Ah... thank you, Shigeru!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170522,
					"content": "You're welcome. Of course, I get where you're coming from. But you need to understand my position, too. For example...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170523,
					"content": "Uh, what is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170524,
					"content": "For example, it's been another day, where is your manuscript!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170516,
					"content": "I guess he is not convinced...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170517
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2201706,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2201704
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2201704",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2201704,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Shigeru",
					"Junkichi"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 220170601,
					"content": "I think this novel has the same fantasy background as \"Onibudou\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170602,
					"content": "Yes. The setting in this novel is very popular. The author even wrote a book just about the details of the world, and that one sold like hotcakes!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Junkichi"
				},
				{
					"id": 220170603,
					"content": "However, the features of the setting are presented to the reader from the very beginning and more aren't added in halfway through. Plus, it's all relevant to the plot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220170604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Shigeru"
				},
				{
